translate zh evscr_nijah_rescue_3_dbb6bba6:

    # MC @ talk "My room is just there down the Hall."
    MC @ talk "我的房间就在走廊那头。"

# game/data/world_events/nijah_rescue/scr_nijah_rescue_3.rpy:37
translate zh evscr_nijah_rescue_3_39dfb4c3:

    # "With my hand on her back, I pointed towards the door at the end of the hallway which Nijah nervously headed towards,"
    "我轻扶她的背，指向走廊尽头的门，妮雅紧张地朝那边走去，"

# game/data/world_events/nijah_rescue/scr_nijah_rescue_3.rpy:39
translate zh evscr_nijah_rescue_3_16d764cf:

    # "With her hand on the door handle, she anxiously looking back at me again to be sure, to which I once again waved to tell her go in."
