    REGINA @ talk "如果卫兵发现我们收容无证难民，我们会被关进大牢的！"

# game/data/world_events/nijah_rescue/scr_nijah_rescue_3.rpy:47
translate zh evscr_nijah_rescue_3_48308e13:

